            "title": "Create Your First Application",
            "part": "Part 5: ACE & MQ"
          }
        ],
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "note",
            "text": "The first application receives `FirstName` and `LastName`, generates an `Id` in the program, and passes the three values to the first queue. The second application concatenates `FirstName` and `LastName` into `FullName` and passes the result to the second queue."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "number": 5,
        "text": "Add a message flow to each application.",
        "links": []
      },
      {
        "number": 6,
        "text": "Build the flow of the first application.",
        "links": [],
        "blocks": [
          {
